      "field": "lead",
      "sourceTextSha256": "511a885a2b3a62c4498404cc193172f863032db977310d9eda57d122fe8762fa",
      "text": "This 6-day journey brings together Lima, Cusco, the Sacred Valley and Machu Picchu. Explore the capital's colonial centre and the Larco Museum, visit Chinchero, Moray and Ollantaytambo, and travel to Machu Picchu on the luxurious Hiram Bingham train. The programme also includes gourmet dinners at Casa Moreyra and the MAP restaurant.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-mw5hnkfi-amanda",
        "model": "GPT-6",
        "wordAbsenceReason": "The Word overview describes a different seven-day structure and has no corresponding six-day lead with Larco, Chinchero, Moray, Ollantaytambo, Casa Moreyra and MAP. This block translates the immutable RU lead without changing its facts."
      }
